<footer>ShopTrack opstillingsark &nbsp;·&nbsp; ${e.partNumber||``} / ${e.machine||``} &nbsp;·&nbsp; ${new Date().toLocaleDateString(`da-DK`,{day:`2-digit`,month:`short`,year:`numeric`})}</footer>
